  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 4750,
      "text": "Is this [punishment] magic, or do you not see?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 524,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4751,
      "text": "Burn in it, whether you bear it patiently or impatiently, it makes no difference to you[8]; you are recompensed only for what you used to do.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 524,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4752,
      "text": "Indeed, the righteous will be in gardens and bliss,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 524,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4753,
      "text": "enjoying what their Lord has given them, and their Lord protected them from the punishment of the Blazing Fire.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 524,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4754,
      "text": "“Eat and drink pleasantly for what you used to do,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 524,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4755,
      "text": "reclining on couches all lined up”. And We will marry them to houris with wide beautiful eyes.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 524,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4756,
      "text": "As for those who believe and their offspring follow them in faith, We will cause their offspring to join them, and will not detract anything from [the reward of] their deeds. Everyone will be accountable for what he earned[9].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 524,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4757,
      "text": "And We will provide them with whatever fruit and meat they desire.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 524,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4758,
      "text": "They will pass around to one another a glass [of pure wine] which does not lead to idle talk or sin.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 524,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4759,
      "text": "They will be served by their servant boys, as if they were well-protected pearls.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 524,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4760,
      "text": "They will turn to one another with questions[10].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 524,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4761,
      "text": "They will say, “Before this, we used to be in awe [of Allah] when we were living among our people.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 524,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4762,
      "text": "Therefore Allah conferred favor upon us and protected us from the punishment of the Scorching Fire.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 524,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4763,
      "text": "Indeed, we used to call upon Him before. He is indeed the Most Kind, the Most Merciful.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 524,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4764,
      "text": "So keep exhorting [O Prophet], for you are not, by the grace of your Lord, a soothsayer or a madman.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 524,
      "ruku": 459,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4765,
      "text": "Or do they say: “He is a poet for whom we await a misfortune[11]”?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 524,
      "ruku": 459,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4766,
      "text": "Say, “Wait, I too am waiting with you.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 31,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
